      "label": "Misogynistic Stereotype: All Men Are Dogs",
      "description": "The meme relies on a misogynistic stereotype that dehumanizes men by comparing them to dogs, implying they are inherently animalistic, untrustworthy, or lacking in moral character. This is a common trope in misogynistic humor that reinforces harmful gender stereotypes and blames women's emotional state on men's supposed inherent flaws.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
