      "instance_name": "mapping_1",
      "label": "Woman is mapped as the victim of misogynistic stereotype",
      "description": "The visual entity 'woman_on_bed' is mapped onto the textual entity 'text_chunk_1' ('all men are dogs..') through the analogical mapping that frames her emotional distress as a consequence of the generalized male behavior described in the text. The woman's distressed expression and posture visually represent the emotional suffering implied by the misogynistic stereotype, creating a direct analogical link between her state and the text's dehumanizing claim about men.",
