      "label": "User projected onto the woman as the victim of misogynistic stereotype",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the visual entity 'woman_on_bed', who is depicted as emotionally distressed, implying that the user identifies with her suffering as a consequence of the misogynistic stereotype described in the text. The text 'so which breed is your dad?' uses 'your' to directly address the user, making the user the target of the insult and thus projected onto the scene and the woman's emotional state.",
