      "instance_name": "toxicity_1",
      "label": "Misogynous",
      "description": "The meme uses a misogynistic stereotype by generalizing all men as 'dogs' — a degrading metaphor implying men are inherently animalistic, untrustworthy, or lacking in moral character. The question 'so which breed is your dad?' escalates the insult by implying the father (a man) is a specific, undesirable type of dog, reinforcing the dehumanizing and derogatory stereotype. The visual of the woman looking downcast or defeated is used to imply she is suffering from this generalized male behavior, which is a classic misogynistic framing that blames women's emotional state on men's supposed inherent flaws.",
