      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "misogynistic humor audience",
      "description": "The target community for this meme is individuals who are familiar with and may find amusement in misogynistic stereotypes, particularly those who perceive or have been affected by generalized negative portrayals of men. The meme relies on culturally understood metaphors (dogs, dog breeds) and the visual trope of a distressed woman to frame male behavior as the source of female emotional distress, appealing to an audience that either validates or enjoys this type of dehumanizing humor. This audience may include people who resonate with the idea that men are inherently flawed or animalistic, or who find satisfaction in mocking or ridiculing men through exaggerated stereotypes.",
